 🪔 Hello, Sunday, and happy Diwali . Smart Brevity™ count: 1,986 words ... 7½ mins. Erica Pandey is your weekend host. Edited by Andrew Pantazi. 

 🥊 Situational awareness: UFC CEO Dana White says he'll meet with President Trump tomorrow about Trump's offer to make him the new White House press secretary. Go deeper. 

 🏛️ Democratic House members and members-elect are being bombarded with phone calls and emails urging them not to elect Minority Leader Hakeem Jeffries (D-N.Y.) as speaker, more than a dozen lawmakers and aides tell Axios' Andrew Solender. Actor Mark Ruffalo's post on X calling for "a new speaker" has been driving much of the outreach. Keep reading. 🔎 Sen. Chris Coons (D-Del.), incoming chair of Senate Foreign Relations, said he'll investigate spying allegations about a Chinese businesswoman who had a close relationship with Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang. 
 
